{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "b8824ef65ffdddf8",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "03B  User pathways | recording, clip, playback, and cleanup",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1080,
      "height": 1920,
      "color": "#4a6080"
    },
    {
      "id": "c2461c464fa16dde",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 03B  User pathways — recording, clip, playback, and cleanup",
      "x": 44,
      "y": 45,
      "width": 992,
      "height": 65,
      "color": "#00d4ff"
    },
    {
      "id": "80a328f8bb793a02",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Open confirmed bout**",
      "x": 453,
      "y": 156,
      "width": 197,
      "height": 78,
      "color": "#4a6080"
    },
    {
      "id": "322c1ccda420358d",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Import Recordings**\nPhotosPicker: up to 20 videos",
      "x": 458,
      "y": 262,
      "width": 188,
      "height": 78,
      "color": "#2d7aff"
    },
    {
      "id": "0bb4acce7ae7902f",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**BoutImportCoordinator.prepareSelections**\nPhotoLibraryService reads metadata / Photos IDs\nshow batch, failures, cancellation",
      "x": 408,
      "y": 367,
      "width": 287,
      "height": 78,
      "color": "#00e5a0"
    },
    {
      "id": "f064347f634e3fdd",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Confirm batch**\ninsert SourceRecording links in SwiftData\ntry linking iCloud Photos IDs",
      "x": 428,
      "y": 488,
      "width": 246,
      "height": 78,
      "color": "#00e5a0"
    },
    {
      "id": "acee2221b0728871",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Review and Trim Recordings**\nload ordered sources + clips",
      "x": 459,
      "y": 593,
      "width": 184,
      "height": 78,
      "color": "#2d7aff"
    },
    {
      "id": "8f4aa955c653300a",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Open source**\nPhotoKit AVAsset; local fallback if needed",
      "x": 429,
      "y": 693,
      "width": 246,
      "height": 78,
      "color": "#00e5a0"
    },
    {
      "id": "c435af208d180a56",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Select trim range**\nClipWorkflow.createClip -> AVFoundation export\nReviewClip: exporting -> pendingUpload",
      "x": 411,
      "y": 798,
      "width": 281,
      "height": 78,
      "color": "#00e5a0"
    },
    {
      "id": "0563c7fb9c862825",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**ClipUploadQueue.upload**\nsync metadata -> save CKAsset\nReviewClip: uploading -> available",
      "x": 364,
      "y": 919,
      "width": 212,
      "height": 78,
      "color": "#00d4ff"
    },
    {
      "id": "35dcd863403ba828",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Failure path**\nexportFailed / pendingUpload / needsAttention\nretry export or upload",
      "x": 457,
      "y": 1040,
      "width": 271,
      "height": 78,
      "color": "#ff4d6a"
    },
    {
      "id": "4e77166f3190719c",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Play clip / Play Bout**\nordered ReviewClips -> playableURL",
      "x": 215,
      "y": 1040,
      "width": 226,
      "height": 78,
      "color": "#2d7aff"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ef94b5b143d6f31",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Local export or managed cache?**",
      "x": 133,
      "y": 1153,
      "width": 389,
      "height": 78,
      "color": "#ff8c42"
    },
    {
      "id": "615c48fc40fa741a",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**ClipDownloadCoordinator.resolve**\ncheck iCloud -> download CKAsset -> cache",
      "x": 102,
      "y": 1270,
      "width": 264,
      "height": 78,
      "color": "#00e5a0"
    },
    {
      "id": "b354d855fb8f462b",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**MediaPlayerModel + BoutPlaybackQueue**\nseek, scrub, speed, next clip (continuous)",
      "x": 204,
      "y": 1369,
      "width": 248,
      "height": 78,
      "color": "#00e5a0"
    },
    {
      "id": "af60496352414412",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Unload / Clear Local Copies**\nonly confirmed available exports; clear cache\nretain CloudKit records/assets",
      "x": 197,
      "y": 1484,
      "width": 262,
      "height": 78,
      "color": "#ff8c42"
    },
    {
      "id": "2e5e5a0f2cf2a865",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Delete clip/source/bout/tournament**\nasset first, then local records, queue metadata deletion\nPhotos original stays intact",
      "x": 667,
      "y": 156,
      "width": 312,
      "height": 78,
      "color": "#ff4d6a"
    },
    {
      "id": "155e15c1054d59cc",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**How to read**  Export or cloud failures retain retry states. Playback uses local export/cache or downloads an edited CKAsset. Cleanup leaves Photos originals intact.",
      "x": 52,
      "y": 1585,
      "width": 976,
      "height": 75,
      "color": "#00d4ff"
    },
    {
      "id": "3ab6c467de8fff32",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Color legend",
      "x": 52,
      "y": 1670,
      "width": 976,
      "height": 45
    },
    {
      "id": "59b6336bcd3214e0",
